<title>UK: UBS SETS 50 MILLION WARRANTS ON ABB.</title>
<headline>UBS SETS 50 MILLION WARRANTS ON ABB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Zurich said it has issued up to 50 million American-style call warrants, on ABB bearer shares.</p>
<p>One bearer share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2600 CHF		  PREMIUM	22.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.94 CHF		  GEARING	11.8 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	20.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2285 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
